meta {
  name: Register
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/parlance.v1.AuthService/Register
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "email": "user@example.com",
    "password": "securepassword123",
    "name": "John Doe"
  }
}

docs {
  # Register

  Creates a new user account and returns authentication tokens.

  ## Request
  - `email` (required): User's email address
  - `password` (required): User's password (will be hashed)
  - `name` (required): User's display name

  ## Behavior
  - New users are automatically assigned the "viewer" role
  - Password is hashed with bcrypt before storage
  - Returns both access token (24h) and refresh token (7 days)

  ## Response
  Returns access tokens and user details with roles and permissions.

  ## Example Response
  ```json
  {
    "accessToken": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...",
    "refreshToken": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...",
    "user": {
      "id": "uuid",
      "email": "user@example.com",
      "name": "John Doe",
      "roles": [
        {
          "id": "uuid",
          "name": "viewer",
          "permissions": [...]
        }
      ],
      "createdAt": "2026-03-27T18:40:15+01:00",
      "updatedAt": "2026-03-27T18:40:15+01:00"
    }
  }
  ```

  ## Errors
  - `INVALID_ARGUMENT`: email, password, or name is required
  - `ALREADY_EXISTS`: user with this email already exists
  - `INTERNAL`: failed to create user
}
